><span begin="00:26.130" end="00:26.550">day </span><span begin="00:26.550" end="00:28.020">baby</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.050" end="00:31.410"><span begin="00:28.050" end="00:28.380">While </span><span begin="00:28.380" end="00:28.470">i </span><span begin="00:28.470" end="00:28.830">hide </span><span begin="00:28.830" end="00:29.160">from </span><span begin="00:29.160" end="00:29.640">the </span><span begin="00:29.640" end="00:31.410">sun</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.440" end="00:37.140"><span begin="00:31.440" end="00:31.680">It's </span><span begin="00:31.680" end="00:32.610">better </span><span begin="00:32.610" end="00:33.060">if </span><span begin="00:33.060" end="00:33.390">you </span><span begin="00:33.390" end="00:33.960">don't </span><span begin="00:33.960" end="00:37.140">understand</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.170" end="00:44.160"><span begin="00:37.170" end="00:37.560">Cos </span><span begin="00:37.560" end="00:37.710">you </span><span begin="00:37.710" end="00:38.550">won't </span><span begin="00:38.550" end="00:38.940">know </span><span begin="00:38.940" end="00:39.270">what </span><span begin="00:39.270" end="00:39.420">it's </span><span begin="00:39.420" end="00:40.140">like </span><span begin="00:40.140" end="00:40.680">until </span><span begin="00:40.680" end="00:41.880">you </span><span begin="00:41.880" end="00:44.160">try</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.160" end="00:51.150"><span begin="00:44.160" end="00:44.310">You </span><span begin="00:44.310" end="00:44.730">know </span><span begin="00:44.730" end="00:47.820">i' </span><span begin="00:47.820" end="00:48.060">i'll </span><span begin="00:48.060" end="00:48.180">be </span><span begin="00:48.180" end="00:48.720">waiting </span><span begin="00:48.720" end="00:48.930">on </span><span begin="00:48.930" end="00:49.140">the </span><span begin="00:49.140" end="00:49.620">other </span><span begin="00:49.620" end="00:51.150">side</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.240" end="00:58.170"><span begin="00:51.240" end="00:51.510">And </span><span begin="00:51.510" end="00:54.660">you' </span><span begin="00:54.660" end="00:54.870">all </span><span begin="00:54.870" end="00:55.050">you </span><span begin="00:55.050" end="00:55.500">gotta </span><span begin="00:55.500" end="00:55.800">do </span><span begin="00:55.800" end="00:55.920">is </span><span begin="00:55.920" end="00:56.460">cross </span><span begin="00:56.460" end="00:56.550">the </span><span begin="00:56.550" end="00:58.170">line</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:58.410" end="01:01.830"><span begin="00:58.410" end="00:58.710">I </span><span begin="00:58.710" end="00:59.190">could </span><span begin="00:59.190" end="00:59.730">wait </span><span begin="00:59.730" end="00:59.940">a </span><span begin="00:59.940" end="01:00.480">whole </span><span begin="01:00.480" end="01:00.870">life </span><span begin="01:00.870" end="01:01.830">time</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.070" end="01:04.710"><span begin="01:02.070" end="01:02.400">But </span><span begin="01:02.400" end="01:02.580">you </span><span begin="01:02.580" end="01:02.820">just </span><span begin="01:02.820" end="01:03.120">got </span><span begin="01:03.120" end="01:03.270">to </span><span begin="01:03.270" end="01:04.710">decide</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.740" end="01:10.260"><span begin="01:04.740" end="01:04.920">You </span><span begin="01:04.920" end="01:05.310">know </span><span begin="01:05.310" end="01:08.430">i' </span><span begin="01:08.430" end="01:08.610">i'll </span><span begin="01:08.610" end="01:08.760">be </span><span begin="01:08.760" end="01:09.300">waiting </span><span begin="01:09.300" end="01:09.510">on </span><span begin="01:09.510" end="01:09.750">the </span><span begin="01:09.750" end="01:10.260">other</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.290" end="01:12.780"><span begin="01:10.290" end="01:11.010">Waiting </span><span begin="01:11.010" end="01:11.190"