d="01:57.270">But </span><span begin="01:57.270" end="01:57.450">you </span><span begin="01:57.450" end="01:57.690">just </span><span begin="01:57.690" end="01:57.870">got </span><span begin="01:57.870" end="01:58.110">to </span><span begin="01:58.110" end="01:59.520">decide</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:59.550" end="02:05.100"><span begin="01:59.550" end="01:59.760">You </span><span begin="01:59.760" end="01:59.940">know </span><span begin="01:59.940" end="02:03.240">i' </span><span begin="02:03.240" end="02:03.480">i'll </span><span begin="02:03.480" end="02:03.660">be </span><span begin="02:03.660" end="02:04.170">waiting </span><span begin="02:04.170" end="02:04.350">on </span><span begin="02:04.350" end="02:04.590">the </span><span begin="02:04.590" end="02:05.100">other</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:05.130" end="02:07.410"><span begin="02:05.130" end="02:05.850">Waiting </span><span begin="02:05.850" end="02:06.030">on </span><span begin="02:06.030" end="02:06.300">the </span><span begin="02:06.300" end="02:06.780">other </span><span begin="02:06.780" end="02:07.410">side</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:07.440" end="02:10.590"><span begin="02:07.440" end="02:07.620">Cos </span><span begin="02:07.620" end="02:07.740">they </span><span begin="02:07.740" end="02:07.980">say </span><span begin="02:07.980" end="02:08.280">life's </span><span begin="02:08.280" end="02:08.340">a </span><span begin="02:08.340" end="02:08.940">dream' </span><span begin="02:08.940" end="02:09.300">call </span><span begin="02:09.300" end="02:09.510">this </span><span begin="02:09.510" end="02:10.590">insomnia</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:10.830" end="02:13.980"><span begin="02:10.830" end="02:11.070">Cos </span><span begin="02:11.070" end="02:11.280">this </span><span begin="02:11.280" end="02:11.460">ain't </span><span begin="02:11.460" end="02:12.450">wonderland' </span><span begin="02:12.450" end="02:12.510">it </span><span begin="02:12.510" end="02:12.750">damn </span><span begin="02:12.750" end="02:13.020">sure </span><span begin="02:13.020" end="02:13.170">ain't </span><span begin="02:13.170" end="02:13.980">narnia</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:14.310" end="02:15.960"><span begin="02:14.310" end="02:14.490">And </span><span begin="02:14.490" end="02:14.700">once </span><span begin="02:14.700" end="02:14.820">you </span><span begin="02:14.820" end="02:15.150">cross </span><span begin="02:15.150" end="02:15.240">the </span><span begin="02:15.240" end="02:15.960">line</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:16.140" end="02:17.490"><span begin="02:16.140" end="02:16.350">You </span><span begin="02:16.350" end="02:16.560">can't </span><span begin="02:16.560" end="02:16.860">change </span><span begin="02:16.860" end="02:16.950">your </span><span begin="02:16.950" end="02:17.490">mind</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:17.520" end="02:21.300"><span begin="02:17.520" end="02:17.940">Yeah </span><span begin="02:17.940" end="02:18.120">i'm </span><span begin="02:18.120" end="02:18.210">a </span><span begin="02:18.210" end="02:19.290">monster </span><span begin="02:19.290" end="02:19.650">but </span><span begin="02:19.650" end="02:19.800">i'm </span><span begin="02:19.800" end="02:19.950">no </span><span begin="02:19.950" end="02:21.300">frankenstein</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:21.330" end="02:24.120"><span begin="02:21.330" end="02:21.510">And </span><span begin="02:21.510" end="02:21.720">quite </span><span begin="02:21.720" end="02:22.170">frankly </span><span begin="02:22.170" end="02:22.350">i've </span><span begin="02:22.350" end="02:22.500">been </span><span begin="02:22.500" end="02:22.830">feeling </span><span begin="02:22.830" end="02:23.250">insane </span><span begin="02:23.250" end="02:23.310">in </span><span begin="02:23.310" end="02:23.670">between </span><span begin="02:23.670" end="02:23.760">my </span><span begin="02:23.760" end="02:24.120">eyes</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:24.1